        <a href="https://www.freddiemac.com/pmms/pmms_archives" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Freddie Mac mortgage-rate archive ↗</a>
        <a href="https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/MORTGAGE30US" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FRED 30-year mortgage-rate series ↗</a>
        <a href="https://www.hud.gov/aboutus/fhahistory" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">HUD: FHA history ↗</a>
        <a href="https://www.fanniemae.com/about-us/corporate-governance/fannie-mae-charter" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fannie Mae history ↗</a>
      </div>
      <p class="fine-print">Historical data are subject to revisions and differences in index construction. The home-price chart uses FHFA national All-Transactions HPI fourth-quarter values, 1975–2025. The mortgage-rate chart uses selected annual-average milestones from Freddie Mac's PMMS; it is not a complete weekly-rate series. The 1942–2025 decline count is from the Shiller-based series linked in the accompanying methodology note. Educational information only; not a forecast or investment recommendation.</p>
